silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_02_materialization_leg_yoneda_hom_leg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "MaterializationLegYonedaHomLegExample" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_02_materialization_leg_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'MaterializationLegYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, the arrow Mittens -> VetCarePlan_77 (the clinical summary that also receives head and torso observations along compatible legs) does not survive materialization because the chunk manifest only records what was stored, not what plans the stored record supports (02_materialization_leg.tex proof Step 2); also, Mittens -> VetCarePlan_77 in 02_materialization_leg.tex Step 2" .
